#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1334 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Boundary for the right-hand operand: the Check guards only RFICDTC with not_empty, not RFSTDTC. When RFSTDTC is empty there is nothing to be 'after', so the rule must stay silent -- the sheet condition ('RFICDTC should not be after RFSTDTC') presupposes a reference start date. A fire here would be an over-fire of date_greater_than against an empty comparator."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM class="SPECIAL PURPOSE" label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID   type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col RFSTDTC  type=Char label="Subject Reference Start Date/Time"
col RFICDTC  type=Char label="Date/Time of Informed Consent"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 | 1015 |  | 2020-01-02
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1023 | 1023 |  |
